{
  "version": 3,
  "_note": "Shared seed of the language→docs registry — pure DATA, no language list in code. Every entry points at OFFICIAL LANGUAGE DOCUMENTATION (reference/manual/style guide), not linter rule catalogs: the AI reads the language's own docs — normative sections (deprecations, warnings, avoid/instead guidance) become rules, every code example feeds the what-is-normal reference corpus. A language may have several entries; all are learned and merged. Languages NOT listed are DISCOVERED on the fly (web search → crawl-validate) and cached per user in ~/.cache/helpers/lint-index/sources.json; share a discovered entry by committing it here (lint_submit).",
